            <listPerson>
                <person xml:id="WOO10" sex="1">
                    <persName>
                        <roleName/>
                        <forename>Samuel</forename>
                        <surname>Woodforde</surname>
                        <addName/>
                    </persName>
                    <birth when="1763-03-29">
                        <placeName>Castle Cary</placeName>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1817-07-27"/>
                    <occupation>painter</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>The identification is based on the company at the Reveley dinner of 14 December 1793. Subsequent references to 'Woodford' appear also to be to the painter.
    All subsequent 'Woodford' entries are associated with Reveley. There is, however, a ten year gap between the last 1796 entry and an 1806 entry for 'Woodfords' .  This has no such link. Moreover, the <title>DNB</title>
    suggests that Woodforde does not marry until 1815. This entry has not been coded.</p>
                    </note>
